00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:09.800
In addition, a report of unsheltered accumulated dose will be forwarded once daily to the EOC.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:19.740
In this city's RADEF monitoring network, there are 18 stations.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:24.330
Fourteen of these are established at fire stations, police stations,

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:26.590
and other government or industrial locations.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.960
